<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- FILIMONI - Tonga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibbuku LyaFilimoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Film</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lugwalo LwaPawulu Kuli</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIMONI</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lugwalo lufwiifwi lwaFilimoni lwakalembwa amutumwa Pawulu (Filimoni 1:1). Pawulu wakalemba lugwalo oolu kali muntolongo kuyeeyelwa kuti wakalulemba kali kuRoma. Kuti kali wakali kuRoma kweelede kuti lwakalembwa kakuli kwayinda minyaka ili makkumi alimusanu akkumi limwi amunyaka uumwi kali Kkirisitu wazyalwa, nchichicho lubo chiindi nchaakalemba BaKkolose.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wakalemba lugwalo oolu kumwaalumi utegwa Filimoni. Filimoni wakali umwi wambungano mpawo kajisi bazike. Pawulu wakamulembela Filimoni kamukumbila kuti atapi chisubulo kumuzike wakwe Onisimasi ooyo wakali wamuchija. Kumulawu wabaRoma Filimoni wakalijisi cheelelo chakumujeya Onisimasi. Pawulu ubelesya majwi akumukombelezya Filimoni kuti amutambule Onisimasi mbuli munyina muli Kkirisitu, nikuba akukumbila kuti Onisimasi amuzumizye kubelekela aamwi Pawulu (Filimoni 1:13-14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu ujuzya Filimoni (Filimoni 1:1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo Pawulu ukumbilila Onisimasi kuti Filimoni amutambule mbuli munyina muli Kkirisitu (Filimoni 1:4-21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu umanisya akwaambilizya mizeezo yakwe yakuswaya, mpawo akubajuzya (Filimoni 1:22-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Ime Pawulu, uli mubwaange nkaambo kaKkirisitu Jesu, aTimoti mukwesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Kuli Filimoni simulimuma uyandwa <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />aAfiya muchizi wesu aAkkipasi silumambama, ambungano ili muŋanda yako:<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:7">Rom 1:7</ref>.</char>
    </note> Luzyalo alumuuno luzwa kuli Leza Taata wesu aMwami Jesu Kkirisitu lube kulindinywe.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luyando Alusyomo LwaFilimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4. </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Roma 1:8.</char>
    </note> Ndilumba Leza wangu chiindi choonse nindikuyeeya munkombyo zyangu, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />nkaambo ndimvwide lusyomo ndulaalo muMwami Jesu Kkirisitu aluyando lwako kubasalali boonse, <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />alimwi ndikomba kuti kwaabilana kwalusyomo lwanu kube kusumpula luzibo lwabubotu boonse ndutulaalo muli Kkirisitu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Mukwesu ndakajana lukondo lupati akuumbuligwa kuzwa kuluyando lwako, nkaambo myooyo yabasalali yakabukulusigwa kwiinda mulinduwe.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukumbilila Onisimasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Nkikaako, nikuba kuti ndili abusichamba muli Kkirisitu bwakukulayilila kuti uchite zyeelede, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />anu kuti ime Pawulu, ndimunene ndasala kukumbila kulinduwe, ankaambo kaluyando ime, alimwi lubo ndimwange waKkirisitu Jesu, <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Kkol 4:9</ref>.</char></note> Ndakukumbila nkaambo kamwana wangu, Onisimasi, kandili ndime wakabawisi mubwaange. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Chiindi chakayinda taakwe naakali alugwasyo pe kulindinywe, pesi lino ulaalugwasyo kulinduwe akulindime.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Ndilamubweedezya kulinduwe, ndamutuma mbuli ndituma moyo wangu. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Chali kunoondikonda loko kuti kandichili aawe, kuchitila kuti andikutawukile abusena bwanu muchiindi chabwaange bwangu muntolongo nkaambo kamakani mabotu; <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />pesi ndasala kutachita chintu kanditakwe nindazuminana andinywe kuchitila kuti bubotu bwanu butabi bwakumanikizigwa biya pe pesi bube kulwaangunuko lwanu.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Ambweni nchiichicho eecho nchaakali wapambulwa kuzwa kulinduwe kwakayindi, kuchitila kuti akabe anduwe kwalyoonse, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />katachili mbuli muzike pe pesi muzike ulimbubo, mbuli mukwesu uyandwa, kapati kulindime pesi kachiindilide kapati biyeni kulinduwe, aamwi mbuli muntu amukwesu muMwami.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Aboobo kuti kamunditambula mbuli simulimunyokwe, amumutambule Onisimasi mbuli mbumukonzya kunditambula. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Kuti wakamubisizya, naa kajisi chikwelete kulindinywe, milandu eeyo muyibikke alindime. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Ime, Pawulu, ndalemba eechi aluboko lwangu, ndiyooliya, kakutakwe nchindaamba nikuba inywe lwanu akundiliya abuumi bwenu. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Iyii, mukwesu, ndiyanda kujana kulinduwe muMwami. Bukulusya moyo wangu muli Kkirisitu.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Ndili achoonzyo akuswiilila kwako, nindili kukulembela, kandizi kuti uyoochita zyiinda eezyo nzindakumbila. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Chimwi chintu ncheechi, ndibambile ŋanda yabeenzu, nkaambo ndilabulangilizi kwiinda munkombyo zyanu kuti ndizumizigwe kuza kulindinywe.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujuzya Kwamamanino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kkol 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4:12</ref>.</char>
    </note> Epafurasi, mwaangema nkaambo kaKkirisitu Jesu, ulamujuzya, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Kkol 4:9</ref>.</char></note> alimwi Makko aArisitakkasi aDemasi aLukku basimulimuma balakujuzya alabo.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Luzyalo lwaMwami Jesu Kkirisitu lube amuuya wanu.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>